<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Balance Druids in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>For Phase 3, we are only interested in Tier 15. Previous tiers are too weak to consider when looking at the item level gap. Additionally, Tier 14 is worth replacing for item level upgrades even if you lose the set bonus.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-15">
